2. eexpokit/ is derived from EXPOKIT
------------------------------------

The C++ routines in eexpokit/ -- padm(), chbv(), expv(), mexpv(),
loadcrs() -- are ports of the corresponding EXPOKIT MATLAB scripts
(padm.m, chbv.m, expv.m, mexpv.m, loadcrs.m).  They derive from Sidje's
work: the algorithms, the coefficient tables and the structure of the code
follow it directly, and several files retain descriptive comments
verbatim.

This NOTICE records the fact.  It makes no claim, in either direction,
about whether the MPL-2.0 grant on eexpokit/ is consistent with the
non-commercial restriction above.  That question is unresolved and should
be settled with the copyright holder before eigen-expokit is used
commercially or offered for upstreaming.

